{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":207700,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":6724.495875999999,"text":"Doch nach dem Verlust des Tors des Kapitäns erzielte Indien nur 36 Runden und"},{"kind":"text","t":6988.197303999999,"text":"But after losing their captain's wicket, India scored only 36 runs."},{"kind":"audio","t":7036.368423,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":7037.9669109999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7039.064754999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7040.70737,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":7040.874142000001,"samples":5128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":10114.803412,"text":"und verlor sieben Tore, womit die Innings beendet waren."},{"kind":"text","t":10306.507521,"text":"and lost seven wickets, ending the innings."},{"kind":"audio","t":10347.093382,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":10348.56596,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10349.356752,"samples":13064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":19555.713963000002,"text":"Sie haben normalerweise ein besonderes Angebot an Speisen, Getränken und Unterhaltung, um die Gäste bei Laune zu halten und dafür zu sorgen, dass sie bleiben."},{"kind":"text","t":19887.779664,"text":"They usually offer special deals on food, drinks, and entertainment to keep guests happy and ensure they stay."},{"kind":"audio","t":19935.841649,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19937.260386,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19939.027609,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19940.825618000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19942.660212000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19943.647200000003,"samples":22760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":28745.607038000002,"text":"Del Potro hatte im zweiten Satz einen frühen Vorteil, doch auch diesmal war ein Tie-Break erforderlich, nachdem das 6 zu 6 erreicht wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":29158.789437000003,"text":"Del Potro took an early lead in the second set, but again a tie-break was needed after it reached 6-6."},{"kind":"audio","t":29208.009617,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29210.106105000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29211.630022,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29213.43458,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29215.274302,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":29215.875448000003,"samples":17360,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":160},{"kind":"input","t":37112.713495,"text":"Das Internet verbindet sowohl Elemente der Massenkommunikation"},{"kind":"text","t":37249.265026,"text":"The Internet combines elements of mass communication"},{"kind":"audio","t":37290.908971000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37292.566669,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37294.026618,"samples":31064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":41893.712536,"text":"als auch der zwischenmenschlichen Kommunikation."},{"kind":"text","t":42095.782234,"text":"It combines elements of mass communication as well as interpersonal communication."},{"kind":"audio","t":42142.512772,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42144.009397,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42145.674616000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42147.545365,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42148.973747000004,"samples":29728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":610},{"kind":"input","t":51216.902058,"text":"Die Zusammensetzung dieser Kristalle entspricht der Zusammensetzung, die im Urin betroffene Haustiere gefunden wurden."},{"kind":"text","t":51489.812711,"text":"The composition of these crystals corresponds to the composition found in the urine of affected pets."},{"kind":"audio","t":51536.175576,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51537.634934,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51539.335176,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51541.151202,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51543.011946,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":51543.133689,"samples":2360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":55307.596963,"text":"wenn man sie mittels Infrarotspektrofismus betrachtet."},{"kind":"text","t":55441.496569,"text":"when viewed using infrared spectroscopy."},{"kind":"audio","t":55480.116116000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55481.600112,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55482.322871000004,"samples":19664,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":64040.396117,"text":"Auf einigen Routen setzen die größeren Firmen ihre eigenen Flugzeuge ein, aber auf anderen Routen und bei kleineren Firmen traten Schwierigkeiten auf."},{"kind":"text","t":64370.25769700001,"text":"On some routes, larger companies use their own aircraft, but difficulties arose on other routes with smaller companies."},{"kind":"audio","t":64417.11969400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":64418.894558,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64420.654720000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":64422.361622,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64424.21993200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64426.021917000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":64426.24868800001,"samples":11592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":71409.01584000001,"text":"Manche Atome haben instabile Kerne, was bedeutet, dass sie schon bei geringem oder gar keinem Anstoß zerfallen."},{"kind":"text","t":71682.959279,"text":"Some atoms have unstable nuclei, which means they decay even with minimal or no stimulation."},{"kind":"audio","t":71727.529333,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":71729.199369,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":71730.928825,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71732.762227,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":71734.582099,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":71734.830403,"samples":11360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":80079.005991,"text":"Im selben Monat schoss ein weiteres Passagierflugzeug über das Ende."},{"kind":"text","t":80240.373222,"text":"That same month, another passenger plane crashed."},{"kind":"audio","t":80279.48402,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":80281.132283,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80282.226181,"samples":26264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":88803.993565,"text":"einer Landebahn in Mashhad hinaus und stieß mit einer Mauer zusammen, wobei 17 Menschen ums Leben kamen."},{"kind":"text","t":89153.759335,"text":"It veered off a runway in Mashhad and collided with a wall, killing 17 people."},{"kind":"audio","t":89198.687208,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89200.364955,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89202.065348,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":89203.970258,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":89204.789001,"samples":19528,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":102934.79603700001,"text":"Fast alle sind Sandstrände mit sicheren Bademöglichkeiten und die meisten bieten Schatten, der von Pohutukawa-Bäumen gespendet wird."},{"kind":"text","t":103302.50375,"text":"Almost all are sandy beaches with safe swimming conditions, and most offer shade provided by pohutukawa trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":103349.229993,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103351.039529,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103352.852991,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":103354.715888,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103356.647038,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103358.641322,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"audio","t":103358.773692,"samples":4992,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":114066.400927,"text":"Zu den beliebten Sportarten gehören Fußball, Basketball, Volleyball, Wasserball, Fechten, Rugby, Radfahren, Eishockey, Rollhockey und Formel 1 Motorsport."},{"kind":"text","t":114527.41108800001,"text":"Popular sports include football, basketball, volleyball, water polo, fencing, rugby, cycling, ice hockey, roller hockey, and Formula 1 racing."},{"kind":"audio","t":114576.416505,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114578.32561100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114580.173325,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114582.0417,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114583.914632,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114585.792822,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114587.729259,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114589.483903,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"audio","t":114589.633669,"samples":56,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":121593.235509,"text":"Im warmen Klima des Mittleren Ostens kamen Häusern keine so große Bedeutung zu."},{"kind":"text","t":121871.10146800001,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, houses did not hold such great significance."},{"kind":"audio","t":121914.399315,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121916.219667,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":121918.05336,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121919.874895,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121920.329359,"samples":14128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":130831.05031700002,"text":"Der Archipel liegt 120 km nördlich der Halbinsel. Die größte ist King George Island mit der Siedlung Villa Las Estrellas."},{"kind":"text","t":131154.304763,"text":"The archipelago is located 120 km north of the peninsula. The largest is King George Island, with the settlement of Villa Las Estrellas."},{"kind":"audio","t":131197.161845,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131198.875988,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131200.805385,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131202.976776,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":131203.127504,"samples":8728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":131241.75242900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131243.27052700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":131245.066963,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131246.939174,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":131247.077643,"samples":8728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":137614.270583,"text":"Der Kohlsaft ändert seine Farbe, je nachdem wie sauer oder basisch alkalisch die Chemikalie ist."},{"kind":"text","t":137949.546681,"text":"The color of the cabbage juice changes depending on whether the chemical is acidic or basic/alkaline."},{"kind":"audio","t":137995.194459,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137996.779967,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137998.589454,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138000.390858,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138002.188917,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":138002.534638,"samples":12560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":142715.533494,"text":"Die Brücke soll im September 2017 vollständig den Betrieb aufnehmen."},{"kind":"text","t":142976.849617,"text":"The bridge is scheduled to begin full operation in September 2017."},{"kind":"audio","t":143021.294953,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143023.52969,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143024.841997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143026.684584,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":143027.004085,"samples":12328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":147824.053439,"text":"Es wird erwartet, dass die brasilianischen Zollpunkte dann fertiggestellt sein werden."},{"kind":"text","t":148055.88573,"text":"It is expected that the Brazilian customs checkpoints will be completed by then."},{"kind":"audio","t":148109.049251,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148110.61486,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148112.484787,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148114.374214,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"audio","t":148114.502337,"samples":928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":158128.460505,"text":"Die Feuchtigkeit auf ihren Händen reagiert mit den äußeren Schichten, was sich komisch anfühlt und eine Art Schutzschicht bildet."},{"kind":"text","t":158471.293449,"text":"The moisture on their hands reacts with the outer layers, which feels strange and forms a kind of protective layer."},{"kind":"audio","t":158518.818786,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158520.961063,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158522.272209,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158524.10489,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158525.912594,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158526.979301,"samples":23960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":163921.970791,"text":"Eine Bombe explodierte vor dem Bürogebäude des Generalgouverneurs."},{"kind":"text","t":164138.758023,"text":"A bomb exploded in front of the governor-general’s office building."},{"kind":"audio","t":164182.67953,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164184.472741,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164185.961164,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":164186.476751,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":173063.911376,"text":"Der marokkanische Sultan baute die Stadt als Daelbeda wieder auf und sie wurde von spanischen Händlern, die dort Handelsstützpunkte einrichteten, Casablanca genannt."},{"kind":"text","t":173519.105855,"text":"The Moroccan sultan rebuilt the city as Daelbeda, and it was named Casablanca by Spanish traders who established trading posts there."},{"kind":"audio","t":173568.52246100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173570.507361,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173571.952028,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173573.828495,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":173575.649619,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173577.53511,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173579.161741,"samples":31392,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":180691.68116,"text":"Er wurde von Wong Kang-Seng, dem stellvertretenden Premierminister Singapurs, begrüßt."},{"kind":"text","t":180935.980224,"text":"He was greeted by Wong Kang-Seng, Singapore’s Deputy Prime Minister."},{"kind":"audio","t":180980.155792,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":180981.360648,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":180983.169593,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":180984.47122500002,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":187208.787343,"text":"und sprach mit Lee Hsing-Long, dem Premierminister Singapurs, über Handels- und Terrorismusangelegenheiten."},{"kind":"text","t":187510.967256,"text":"And he discussed trade and terrorism issues with Lee Hsing-Long, Singapore’s Prime Minister."},{"kind":"audio","t":187557.875432,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187559.28445500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187560.983244,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":187562.743036,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187564.038297,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"input","t":200695.456163,"text":"Die Atombombe basiert auf dem Prinzip, dass man Energie benötigt."},{"kind":"text","t":200911.915931,"text":"The atomic bomb is based on the principle that energy is required."},{"kind":"audio","t":200955.75952,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200956.986759,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200958.785379,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200959.737434,"samples":23496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"input","t":201265.45019,"text":"um einen Kern mit vielen Protonen und Neutronen zusammenzusetzen."},{"kind":"text","t":201467.653808,"text":"to form a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"audio","t":201509.961193,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201511.451488,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201513.194033,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"audio","t":201513.332052,"samples":1896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":207308.478863,"text":"Für die Archipel und Seen brauchen Sie nicht unbedingt eine Yacht."},{"kind":"text","t":207552.239776,"text":"You don’t necessarily need a yacht for the archipelagos and lakes."},{"kind":"audio","t":207595.349139,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":207596.86993000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":207598.662671,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":207598.92798100002,"samples":11496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":217803.263199,"code":1005}]}